  "usage_note": "**Daily** as an adverb is common in notices, instructions, and writing (*open daily*, *twice daily*); in speech, **every day** is more usual: *I walk to work every day*. Before a noun, **daily** is an adjective (*a daily newspaper*), a separate entry.",
